   "title" -> "Objects in SolutionsX", "summary" -> 
    "A solution is an association over eighteen object types. Each entry \
records the arguments of one xAct definition, so that the definition can be \
validated before it is made, stored after it is made, and replayed on demand. \
This note walks through the object system.", "context" -> 
    "VasilDimitrov`SolutionsX`", "paclet" -> "VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX", 
